  "html": "<p>The Kingdom Representative is the main quest giver in Dew Valley. He gives a series of quests that are designed to introduce new players into how the game works.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Kingdom_Representative.27s_Quests\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Kingdom Representative's Quests</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley_Infestation\" title=\"Dew Valley Infestation\">Dew Valley Infestation</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coin\" title=\"Kings Coin\">Kings Coin</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Red_Rocks\" title=\"Red Rocks\">Red Rocks</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Fizz_Rock_Delivery\" title=\"Fizz Rock Delivery\">Fizz Rock Delivery</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Defeat_the_Blade_Masters\" title=\"Defeat the Blade Masters\">Defeat the Blade Masters</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Rattle_Tooths_Lair\" title=\"Find Rattle Tooths Lair\">Find Rattle Tooths Lair</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Kill_Rattle_Tooth\" title=\"Kill Rattle Tooth\">Kill Rattle Tooth</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley_Extermination\" title=\"Dew Valley Extermination\">Dew Valley Extermination</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Kingdom_Representative.27s_Advanced_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Kingdom Representative's Advanced Quests</span></h2>\n<p>Later in the game, believe it or not, he returns to offer\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/King's_Hit_List_Part_3\" title=\"King's Hit List Part 3\">King's Hit List Part 3</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
